SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Mikaya
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, June 28th\n\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Mikaya\
 n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb) is a facilitato
 r at AMC and creator of dance waves with many styles and flavors within th
 e Ecstatic Dance realm. His deejay skill has spanned over two decades cove
 ring many ecstatic dance containers\, festivals\, sound healing events and
  yoga classes. You can listen to his catalog of over 80 mixes and mashups 
 at **[http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb](http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb
 )**\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. T
 he doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late will 
 be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \
 \*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for 
 lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nFirst Wave: 
 [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/uqbb](https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/uqbb)\nSecond Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 6r3x](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/6r3x)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need
  volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndx
 M3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_R
 Ht9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT 
 ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Pl
 ease note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreeme
 nts:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6a
 ExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_
 Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\
 nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in
  harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving c
 ommunity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy comm
 unity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and comm
 unity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee yo
 u on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/314542266/
