UID:event_315187878@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043141Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T210000
SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Karen Funshine
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 3\nEvening Dance 
 Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGuest D
 J Karen Funshine \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout 
 Guest DJ Karen Funshine\nKaren Funshine (Karen Smith) has been dancing sin
 ce age 3\, with movement as her lifelong ally. A veteran raver & EDM enthu
 siast\, she was delighted to discover 5Rhythms and ecstatic dance 10 years
  ago in Austin - a sober and judgment-free space to get wild & free. She
 ’s since facilitated many women’s conscious dance circles and a vibran
 t live-instrument dance - weaving music and somatic movement to alchemize 
 emotion\, open the heart\, and awaken joy. Recently relocated to Asheville
 \, Karen is honored to share her passion and playfulness with her beautifu
 l new community through the universal language of music and dance.\n\n\\~\
 \~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors cl
 ose promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away.
  Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket P
 rices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of fun
 ds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseige
 a.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2l
 kEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne
 3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteer
 s. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashev
 illemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNyd
 GMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwg
 nJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMEN
 TS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note
 : NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[ht
 tps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam
 10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxg
 UcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AM
 C:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony 
 where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community.
  Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community thr
 ough free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community tra
 nsformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Be
 ll Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/315187878/
