 for the hare\nWith hope against hope\nThat the beer was still there\n\nO h
 ey does that mark say\n“Beer near\,” am I saved?\nOh no\, we’ve been
  fucked!\nThe hares are depraved.\n\nOn Afters is at ...hare has to skeeda
 ddle after trail\, but y’all might come up with somethin’\n\n**ON-ON!*
