X-SOURCE-ID:ashevilleart
X-SOURCE:Asheville Art Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260705T150000
DTSTAMP:20260623T135036Z
CREATED:20260611T142132Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260623T135036Z
UID:10006753-1783256400-1783263600@www.ashevilleart.org
SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds | Lo Wolf
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a live performance by Lo Wolf\, local harpist. \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nCaptivated at an early age by this incredible instrument\, Lo has a unique and improvisational style honed by years of study in the classical and Celtic modes. She brings her singer-songwriter sensibilities to bear and draws on the world around her to create soothing and memorable soundscapes that reflect the beauty she sees. Performances will take place July 5\, 19\, and August 2. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
URL:https://www.ashevilleart.org/event/sunday-sounds-lo-wolf/2026-07-05/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Performance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ashevilleart.org/wp-content/uploads/Lo-Wolf-Harp-scaled.jpg
GEO:35.5946714;-82.5512827
