SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 19th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFaci
 litator Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Sara Bensman\n\nSara’
 s mix-making arises from musical exploration. She seeks to understand ener
 gy through somatic responses to sonic vibrations. Her facilitation is prop
 elled by a desire to help build and sustain community by creating a safe\,
  loving container for self-expression\, connection and release. If you’d
  like to listen to her sets visit [https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman](ht
 tps://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that t
 he dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and
  any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a saf
 e and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your pric
 e.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:
 \n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Regist
 er to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](
 https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMT
