SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Marta Martin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 19th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFaci
 litator Marta Martin\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Facilitator Marta Martín
 \n\nMarta (she/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to Asheville
  from Surfside\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for over 30 ye
 ars\, using music and movements from around the world.\nShe loves to motiv
 ate people to find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the spirit
 .\nListen to her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta
 /](https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soun
 dcloud.com/dancingmarta](https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta) )\n\n\\~\\~\
 \~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close
  promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Pl
 ease be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Pric
 es: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!
 \nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volun
 teer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vol
 unteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX
 2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I
 _3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\
 nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO E
 NTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcolle
 ctive.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0
 RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_
 LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAs
 heville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where 
 all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our m
 ission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through f
 ree-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transform
