 d trivia at Wicked Weed Funkatorium! Connect with fellow young professiona
 ls while enjoying one of Asheville’s most unique brewery experiences. Wi
 cked Weed Brewing’s Funkatorium\, the first sour-focused taproom on the 
 East Coast\, is renowned for its award-winning mixed culture program\, wor
 ld-class sour beers\, flagship IPAs\, and exclusive small-batch brews. PRO
 pel AVL will be hosting trivia\, so bring your competitive spirit and get 
 ready 
