SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance LIVE MUSIC w/ Alex & Friends 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, July 26th\n\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nLIVE MUSIC
  w/ Alex & Friends\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note th
 at the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle
  and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensu
 re a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name you
 r price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-regist
 ration Recommended:\nFirst Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 uqbb](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/uqbb)\nSecond Wave: [https:/
 /ashevillemovementcollective.org/6r3x](https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/6r3x)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free
 ! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volun
 teer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgN
 hZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4O
 TIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_
 JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the be
 ginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE 
 BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollectiv
 e.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbcli
 d=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOT
 E3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDzn
 UA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collectiv
 e envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their a
 uthentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to insp
 ire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting 
 dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) 
 nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
